                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game was successfully funded in 2017. It took three years to get a version on Steam, and what we got was basically the same thing we saw in the video three years ago. The game got the odd update here and there since the Steam released, but it's still little more than a proof of concept. After all this time, the game being a rather simple one, I don't think it's acceptable to have so few features and so many bugs. It feels like the developers are giving this game the minimum amount of attention required to avoid possible lawsuits. I've tried the story mode, and I've tried arcade in coop, and I've had no fun whatsoever.",
