                        "steam_purchase": false,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Hi Languor,\n\nThank you for giving our game a chance. I’m sorry it didn’t live up to your expectations. We are still working on the game and updating it frequently with new features. We are only a two man team so it does take time. I can assure you that we have been working hard on it and poured our love and money into the project, these things just take time. Since 2017 we added arcade mode and story mode, back then there weren't any single-player or co-op modes and we believe that added a lot to the game. Story mode is still in development and we are working on bug fixing as well.\n\n[UPDATE]\nWe just added a bunch of new levels to the story mode, it now contains 15 fun levels that challenge the player and you can play it co-op. I hope you will revisit the game and check out these new features.\n\nTake care,\n/Dennis",
